  "text": "\r\n\t\t Elections | Hollis, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards & Committees   \t\t\t \n     Online Services   \t\t\t \n     Community   \t\t\t \n     How Do I?   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Absentee Ballot Information \r\n\t\t\t How to Vote \r\n\t\t\t Elections \r\n\t\t\t Registering to Vote \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \nElections and Voter Information \nElections \r\nElections\t\t \r\nElection Dates \nState Primary Election - Tuesday September 8, 2026, 7am-7pm at Hollis Brookline High School at 24 Cavalier Court \nGeneral Election - Tuesday November 3, 2026, 7am-7pm at Hollis Brookline High School at 24 Cavalier Court \nTown Election - Tuesday March 9, 2027, 7 am-7 pm at the Lawrence Barn at 28 Depot Road \nTown Elections : Polls are usually at the Lawrence Barn at 28 Depot Road \nState and Federal Elections : Polls are usually at the Hollis Brookline High School at 24 Cavalier Court \nTown elections are held the second Tuesday of March. \nState-wide and Congressional elections are held in even-numbered years, on the Tuesday after the first Monday of November. Presidential elections are held every four years, on the same day. \nPrimaries for state-wide and Congressional elections are held in even-numbered years, the second Tuesday of September. \nPresidential primaries are held early in the year of the Presidential election, at a date to be determined by the NH Secretary of State. \r\nSample Ballots \r\n2026 General Election Sample Ballot (PDF) \r\nElection Results \n2026   Town Election (PDF)  |  State Primary (PDF) \n2025   Town Election (PDF) \n2024   General Election (PDF)  |  State Primary (PDF)  |  Town Election (PDF )  |  Presidential Primary (PDF) \n2023   Town Election (PDF) \n2022   General Election (PDF)  |  State Primary (PDF)  |  Town Election (PDF) \n2021   Town Election (PDF) \n2020   General Election (PDF)  |  State Primary (PDF)  |  Town Election (PDF)  |  Presidential Primary (PDF) \n2019   Town Election (PDF) \n2018   General Election (PDF)  |  State Primary (PDF)  |  Town Election (PDF) \n2017   Town Election (PDF) \n2016   General Election (PDF)  |  State Primary (PDF)  |  Town Election (PDF)  |  Presidential Primary (PDF) \n2015   Town Election (PDF)  |  Hollis/Brookline Cooperative (PDF)  |  School District Election (PDF) \n2014   General Election (PDF) \r\n\t\t\t Minutes & Agenda \r\n\t\t\t Notify Me \r\n\t\t\t Vehicle Registration \r\n\t\t\t Job Opportunities \r\n\t\t\t Notices & Bids \r\n\t\t\t Hours & Contacts \r\nHollis, NH \r\nHollis Town Hall \r\n7 Monument Square \r\nHollis, NH 03049 \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
